==Battleground==
*4 [[Croco]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ovis (Enemy)|Ovis]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

